{"id":"2bfb8b0c113c57df2a9c704f97c23915a8e6357f","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242033","title":"我发现拿 ai 当记事本的效果还真不错啊， agent+记忆框架当记事本很不错欸。","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"lynn1su","excerpt":"程序员 - @lynn1su - 也不用编辑记事本啥的，就让 agent 记住，然后联动闹钟。忘记了直接问 ai","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/记事本\"><li></li> 记事本</a><a href=\"/tag/Agent\"><li></li> Agent</a></P><p><span>17 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-15 16:54:08 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18085438\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f178/a1b8/133660_normal.png?m=1780295222\" alt=\"Haku\" data-uid=\"133660\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Haku\">Haku</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 09:46:37 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很快你就会发现忘了自己忘了什么，也就不知道自己该知道什么了 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18085553\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3a7c1b5d7117a739c28b31639a8b8f8d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tjss\" data-uid=\"640813\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tjss\">tjss</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 09:59:44 +08:00\">20h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>弄个 SKILL ，相当于有了一个带 ai 能力的记事本 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/pmNOo2w.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pmNOo2w.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18085573\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/51d35353d2ae93215a7ee9e7e20abe55?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"skuuhui\" data-uid=\"687707\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/skuuhui\">skuuhui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 10:01:51 +08:00\">20h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你和 ai 说和新建备忘录能省多少事？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18085590\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f59f/474b/434592_normal.png?m=1777788899\" alt=\"lynn1su\" data-uid=\"434592\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lynn1su\">lynn1su</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 10:04:05 +08:00\">20h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/skuuhui\">skuuhui</a> #5 我懒得打开备忘录了。直接家里开语音和 ai 说，ai 通过 asr 转录保存</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086141\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8a8941fbbbab6d98b383cd45ddb7eb33?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Maybez007\" data-uid=\"546137\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Maybez007\">Maybez007</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:07:04 +08:00\">19h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我之前记录饮食就是这样干的，甚至还让 Agent 给我在本地生成了一个 Excel 记录进去。然后差不多大半个月还是多久，Agent 就开始记忆混乱胡言乱语。后续解决方案是 Vibe Coding 了一个应用，然后通过 MCP 给 Agent 去记录和查询。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086374\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9872/ed9f/186_normal.png?m=1778767874\" alt=\"spark\" data-uid=\"186\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/spark\">spark</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:30:37 +08:00\">18h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>LLM wiki?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086469\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c87/06fd/222501_normal.png?m=1506671949\" alt=\"qf19910623\" data-uid=\"222501\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qf19910623\">qf19910623</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:41:31 +08:00\">18h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>重要的东西还是要保存，以知识库的形式让 AI 访问</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086607\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/25df/35de/1225_normal.png?m=1747492427\" alt=\"lihua\" data-uid=\"1225\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lihua\">lihua</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:57:47 +08:00\">18h 12m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让 Hermes Agent 以 Markdown 的格式记录</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086637\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8d13/4c44/631792_normal.png?m=1789105870\" alt=\"sentinelK\" data-uid=\"631792\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sentinelK\">sentinelK</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 12:03:14 +08:00\">18h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>轻度使用可以。但是实际工作中千万不能这么用，AI 会自作聪明，搞混。</p><p>比如两个非常相似的日程，AI 的记忆会串台。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087408\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9a13/cdf6/515943_normal.png?m=1691715989\" alt=\"chengYT\" data-uid=\"515943\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chengYT\">chengYT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:33:14 +08:00\">15h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是直接 vibe coding 了一个给 Obsidian 用的 MCP Vault 接到 ChatGPT 里，完全靠 AI 的记忆系统还是不靠谱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18087445\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc4a/fbcc/274199_normal.png?m=1683209705\" alt=\"Building\" data-uid=\"274199\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Building\">Building</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:38:42 +08:00\">15h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用不了多久你的每个问题结尾就会变成：<br>我记得你...<br>根据/结合你之前的 xxx 我建议...<br>如果你的计划是 xxx 那么...<br>结合你之前提到的 xxx...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088397\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5b7527d95ba69502d8ed793d54940b80?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"woshishui2022\" data-uid=\"741345\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/woshishui2022\">woshishui2022</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 16:54:08 +08:00\">13h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没问题的；记得要让 AI 把原话记录到 md 文件中。<br>我 hermes 接入微信；每天记录待办，和定时推送<br>就是玩了几天，觉得没什么意思，加上微信推送容易断，就关了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"AI 记事本 Agent17 replies • 2026-09-15 16:54:08 +08:00 1 Haku 20h 23m ago 很快你就会发现忘了自己忘了什么，也就不知道自己该知道什么了 4 tjss 20h 10m ago 弄个 SKILL ，相当于有了一个带 ai 能力的记事本 5 skuuhui 20h 8m ago 你和 ai 说和新建备忘录能省多少